1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:01,157
Heavy bleeding?

2
00:00:01,157 --> 00:00:01,701
Act fast.

3
00:00:01,701 --> 00:00:02,789
Here's what to do.

4
00:00:05,750 --> 00:00:10,102
1 — Call emergency services right away, or ask someone nearby to call.

5
00:00:11,250 --> 00:00:15,067
2 — Press hard and firmly on the wound with a clean cloth or gauze.

6
00:00:15,067 --> 00:00:15,922
Use your hands.

7
00:00:16,750 --> 00:00:18,763
3 — Keep pressing without peeking.

8
00:00:18,763 --> 00:00:21,486
If blood soaks through, add more cloth on top.

9
00:00:22,250 --> 00:00:25,493
If you can, have them lie down and raise the injured limb.

10
00:00:25,493 --> 00:00:27,114
Don't remove the first cloth.

11
00:00:27,810 --> 00:00:30,149
Don't pull out objects stuck in the wound.

12
00:00:30,149 --> 00:00:31,151
Press around them.

13
00:00:31,151 --> 00:00:33,378
Stay with the person until help arrives.

14
00:00:34,080 --> 00:00:40,075
Get medical help for any wound that bleeds heavily, spurts, or won't stop after 10 minutes of pressure.
